Introduction
============

Raining Sockets is a non-blocking sockets based framework which lets you
instantiate a class that contains complete non-blocking io. A user only
needs to override the event that he requires to customize, such as
what to do with arrived (or arriving) data, or what to do when a write
has completed.


Thanks
======

Rahul Kumar for a first version



